      "coverage": 0.9373,
      "turnover": null,
      "decay_ic_5d": -0.025443,
      "decay_ic_10d": -0.041689,
      "max_abs_library_correlation": null
    },
    "regime_notes": "Raw signal daily IC was -0.010100 and ICIR -0.4896; persisted direction is reversed. Raw regime IC: 2020-22 -0.016303, 2023-24 -0.012830, 2025-26 -0.026048, 2027-28 +0.016188. Reversal has positive daily IC overall but negative 5/10-day decay; use as short-horizon auxiliary input and interpret small cross-section conservatively."
  },
